{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-AnomalyForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ecb240"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0c373165", "timestamp": "2026-09-18T02:57:00", "text": "Awesome, David! Lastly, there's a 'Improper Input Validation in Form Handling' issue in Django. This aligns with our input validation problem. Here's the PR: https://github.com/django/django/pull/1361. George Jones, could you take a look?", "utterranceID": "20260917-5-d404b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260917-5-d404b"}
