{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9307fe85", "timestamp": "2026-11-06T00:15:00", "text": "Got it! I'll start looking into the logging system to identify the root cause. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261105-2-87354"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261105-2-87354"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-11-06T00:16:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have 'Error Messages Obscuring Controls'. Error messages are blocking critical UI controls, which is preventing users from accessing necessary functions. This is impacting the User Interface and customer CUST-0115. @eid_67f8a879, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261105-3-ae0c1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261105-3-ae0c1"}
