{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bc469a8f", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T17:57:00", "text": "Hi team, I wanted to discuss PR# 41 titled 'Optimize GraphQL API for Performance'. It's approved but not merged yet. I've heard that the product direction has changed, and this PR might no longer be necessary. Can anyone provide more context on this?", "utterranceID": "20261115-0-8989c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-0-8989c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8cbee5b3", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T17:59:00", "text": "Hey @eid_bc469a8f, yes, the product team has decided to pivot away from focusing on GraphQL optimizations for now. We're shifting our priorities to other areas that need immediate attention.", "utterranceID": "20261115-1-b8f3c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-1-b8f3c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01e37306", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T18:03:00", "text": "I agree with @eid_8cbee5b3. The optimizations were initially important, but with the new direction, they might not provide the value we anticipated.", "utterranceID": "20261115-2-1a37b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-2-1a37b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_839e5084", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T18:06:00", "text": "Does this mean the work done in the PR is completely irrelevant, or could it be useful in the future?", "utterranceID": "20261115-3-c7101"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-3-c7101"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_446bc3ee", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T18:09:00", "text": "From a technical standpoint, the optimizations could still be beneficial if we decide to focus on GraphQL performance again. However, if the product direction has shifted, it might not be worth merging right now.", "utterranceID": "20261115-4-a48f7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-4-a48f7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f3ea10f", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T18:13:00", "text": "Is there any risk in keeping the PR open for a while longer, in case the priorities shift back?", "utterranceID": "20261115-5-ce542"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-5-ce542"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9c876927", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T18:14:00", "text": "Keeping it open is an option, but it might clutter our backlog. If we're sure about the shift in priorities, it might be cleaner to close it for now.", "utterranceID": "20261115-6-c1e95"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-6-c1e95"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_97d7392d", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T18:16:00", "text": "I think it's best to not merge it at this point. If the need arises, we can always revisit the optimizations.", "utterranceID": "20261115-7-2d2b2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-7-2d2b2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_accab4fc", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T18:19:00", "text": "Agreed. Let's avoid merging it to keep our codebase aligned with current priorities.", "utterranceID": "20261115-8-ff533"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-8-ff533"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b7a6e7f9", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T18:20:00", "text": "I support the decision to not merge. It seems like the most practical approach given the circumstances.", "utterranceID": "20261115-9-de180"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-9-de180"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_73a50f06", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T18:23:00", "text": "Alright, so it seems like the consensus is to not merge the PR. @eid_446bc3ee, could you please ensure that it remains unmerged?", "utterranceID": "20261115-10-f4046"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-10-f4046"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_446bc3ee", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T18:28:00", "text": "Sure, I'll make sure the PR is not merged. I'll keep it open for now, but I'll mark it as low priority. Thanks for the input, everyone.", "utterranceID": "20261115-11-7a570"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-11-7a570"}

