{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1162dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_16935c12", "timestamp": "2027-01-04T10:08:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that might give us insights into our current issues. Let's take a look! 😊", "utterranceID": "20270104-0-ca0e5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270104-0-ca0e5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1162dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_16935c12", "timestamp": "2027-01-04T10:10:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Data Synchronization Error' in Nextcloud. Users are seeing outdated files due to sync issues between the server and client apps. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/nextcloud/server/pull/4817. @eid_c2a92a40, this seems similar to the sync issue you're working on. Thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20270104-1-0b936"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270104-1-0b936"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1162dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c2a92a40", "timestamp": "2027-01-04T10:14:00", "text": "Thanks, Hannah! This is definitely relevant. I'll review their approach and see if we can apply any of their solutions to our database and UI sync problem. 🔍", "utterranceID": "20270104-2-2767a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270104-2-2767a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1162dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_16935c12", "timestamp": "2027-01-04T10:16:00", "text": "Great! Next, there's a 'Dashboard Rendering Delay' in Grafana. Users experience delays when multiple queries are processed at once. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/grafana/grafana/pull/4818. David Miller, this might be useful for the rendering delay you're tackling.", "utterranceID": "20270104-3-32b91"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270104-3-32b91"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1162dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_987771ee", "timestamp": "2027-01-04T10:18:00", "text": "Awesome find, Hannah! I'll dive into their PR and see if their fixes can help us with our backend server and visualization module. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270104-4-5d069"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270104-4-5d069"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1162dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_16935c12", "timestamp": "2027-01-04T10:19:00", "text": "Lastly, there's an 'Incorrect Code Completion Suggestions' issue in Jupyter Notebook. The suggestion engine is providing irrelevant completions, similar to our AI suggestion problem. Here's the PR: https://github.com/jupyter/notebook/pull/4819. Bob, this might be worth a look.", "utterranceID": "20270104-5-95aae"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270104-5-95aae"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1162dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_67416adf", "timestamp": "2027-01-04T10:23:00", "text": "Thanks, Hannah! I'll check out their approach to see if we can improve our AI suggestion engine. 🤖", "utterranceID": "20270104-6-bc29d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270104-6-bc29d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1162dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_16935c12", "timestamp": "2027-01-04T10:27:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep these open-source solutions in mind as we work through our issues. Feel free to share any insights or questions. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20270104-7-7162e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270104-7-7162e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1162dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c2a92a40", "timestamp": "2027-01-04T10:31:00", "text": "Will do! If anyone else finds relevant open-source examples, please share. It could be a big help. 👍", "utterranceID": "20270104-8-f2b02"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270104-8-f2b02"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1162dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_987771ee", "timestamp": "2027-01-04T10:32:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll keep an eye out for more examples. Let's get these bugs sorted! 💪", "utterranceID": "20270104-9-f727f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270104-9-f727f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1162dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_67416adf", "timestamp": "2027-01-04T10:36:00", "text": "Agreed! Thanks for the collaboration, team. Let's make our product even better! 💡", "utterranceID": "20270104-10-8ed84"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270104-10-8ed84"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1162dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_16935c12", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:23:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with CollaborateForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20270129-0-566e3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-0-566e3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1162dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_16935c12", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:25:00", "text": "First up, we have a Cache Invalidation Issue. Stale data is being served due to improper cache invalidation, affecting the Backend Server & Visualization Module. This is causing slow response times and disrupting discussions for CUST-0097. @eid_67416adf, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20270129-1-14914"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-1-14914"}

