{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ContentRecommender", "channelID": "ch-ender-33b51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_50da4819", "timestamp": "2026-03-04T01:09:00", "text": "For sure, Julia! We can leverage NLP to analyze customer conversations and machine learning to refine recommendations over time. Let's detail this in the tech section.", "utterranceID": "20260303-5-aa8fa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260303-5-aa8fa"}
