{"Channel": {"name": "planning-SalesforceContextualInsights", "channelID": "ch-ights-9a24d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_aa99608e", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T00:57:00", "text": "Hi team, I want to discuss the Product Requirements Document for SalesforceContextualInsights. Let's brainstorm some ideas and outline the key sections we need to include. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260911-0-a2280"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-0-a2280"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-SalesforceContextualInsights", "channelID": "ch-ights-9a24d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d14c4ec", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T01:00:00", "text": "Hey @eid_aa99608e, sounds good! I think we should start by defining the core functionalities of the AI and how it will analyze user behavior. This will be crucial for the engineering team.", "utterranceID": "20260911-1-6b5da"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-1-6b5da"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-SalesforceContextualInsights", "channelID": "ch-ights-9a24d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_abff6bea", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T01:05:00", "text": "Agreed, David. We should also consider how the insights will be presented to users. The UX needs to be intuitive and actionable. Maybe we can include some mockups or wireframes?", "utterranceID": "20260911-2-8cb00"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-2-8cb00"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-SalesforceContextualInsights", "channelID": "ch-ights-9a24d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4f731d34", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T01:08:00", "text": "From a QA perspective, we need to ensure that the insights are accurate and reliable. We should include a section on testing methodologies and criteria.", "utterranceID": "20260911-3-b99ae"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-3-b99ae"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-SalesforceContextualInsights", "channelID": "ch-ights-9a24d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0b6cb92", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T01:09:00", "text": "Great points, everyone. I think we should also include a section on data privacy and how we'll handle user data securely. This is crucial for user trust.", "utterranceID": "20260911-4-527d0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-4-527d0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-SalesforceContextualInsights", "channelID": "ch-ights-9a24d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b34186ad", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T01:13:00", "text": "👍 @eid_d0b6cb92, data privacy is a must. We should outline our compliance with regulations like GDPR.", "utterranceID": "20260911-5-228fa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-5-228fa"}
