{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2026-08-30T05:01:00", "text": "Agreed. We should document these customer issues in our planning documents for the next release of EF_AIX.", "utterranceID": "20260825-6-11e07"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-6-11e07"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e51b439b", "timestamp": "2026-08-30T05:05:00", "text": "Let's make sure we have a detailed section on integration improvements in the next release notes.", "utterranceID": "20260825-7-3fb73"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-7-3fb73"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9db3abf4", "timestamp": "2026-08-31T20:37:00", "text": "Hi team, QA team found some issues in the last release of EF_AIX reported by QA Specialist eid_7f22371d. Let's discuss.", "utterranceID": "20260825-0-06305"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-0-06305"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1a7d9807", "timestamp": "2026-08-31T20:38:00", "text": "Thanks, Alice. What exactly did they find?", "utterranceID": "20260825-1-bd651"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-1-bd651"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9db3abf4", "timestamp": "2026-08-31T20:42:00", "text": "The initial setup process is complex and time-consuming, requiring significant technical expertise.", "utterranceID": "20260825-2-5bc5d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-2-5bc5d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c9c3d8d5", "timestamp": "2026-08-31T20:43:00", "text": "Wasn't this developed and tested by a different team? Maybe they didn't focus enough on user-friendliness.", "utterranceID": "20260825-3-a0424"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-3-a0424"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a253c65a", "timestamp": "2026-08-31T20:44:00", "text": "Could be a lack of comprehensive setup automation tools or scripts. That would definitely make it harder.", "utterranceID": "20260825-4-17745"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-4-17745"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2d8eff4d", "timestamp": "2026-08-31T20:49:00", "text": "Agreed, Hannah. Automation could simplify things a lot. Maybe we should look into creating some scripts.", "utterranceID": "20260825-5-7282f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-5-7282f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_caa2e58d", "timestamp": "2026-08-31T20:51:00", "text": "What about the documentation? If it's inadequate, that could be a big part of the problem too.", "utterranceID": "20260825-6-0160e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-6-0160e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1a7d9807", "timestamp": "2026-08-31T20:55:00", "text": "Good point, Bob. We should review the user guidance provided during setup.", "utterranceID": "20260825-7-306fd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-7-306fd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c9c3d8d5", "timestamp": "2026-08-31T20:59:00", "text": "And operationally, do we have enough support resources to assist users during setup?", "utterranceID": "20260825-8-4801d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-8-4801d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9db3abf4", "timestamp": "2026-08-31T21:03:00", "text": "Let's make sure these issues are documented in our planning documents for the next release of EF_AIX.", "utterranceID": "20260825-9-4c0a3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-9-4c0a3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2026-09-03T01:48:00", "text": "Hi team, one of the common issues reported for EF_AIX is that the user interface is not intuitive for non-technical users. This was reported by Customer ID: CUST-0028.", "utterranceID": "20260916-0-5b37e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260916-0-5b37e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_df282afb", "timestamp": "2026-09-03T01:52:00", "text": "Thanks for bringing this up, Charlie. Since the product was developed by a different team, we might need to dig into their design choices.", "utterranceID": "20260916-1-fd333"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260916-1-fd333"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:39:00", "text": "Hey @eid_a253c65a, for the setup complexity, I think we should add a section on setup automation tools. Maybe we can include scripts or a step-by-step guide to simplify the process. Thoughts? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260915-1-14fd9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-1-14fd9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:40:00", "text": "I agree with Julia. We could also enhance the user guidance section with more detailed documentation. Perhaps a quick-start guide for non-technical users? 📚", "utterranceID": "20260915-2-5b178"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-2-5b178"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c9c3d8d5", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:43:00", "text": "For the performance inconsistencies, should we look into optimizing the data processing algorithms? The document could include a section on performance tuning tips for large datasets. @eid_91523bad, what do you think?", "utterranceID": "20260915-3-b3572"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-3-b3572"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:47:00", "text": "Absolutely, @eid_c9c3d8d5. We should also consider adding a note on recommended hardware specs to ensure consistent performance across devices. 💡", "utterranceID": "20260915-4-9b42e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-4-9b42e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a9002ae2", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:48:00", "text": "Regarding integration options, we might want to expand the integration layer section to include potential APIs or connectors. This could help with third-party app compatibility. 🤝", "utterranceID": "20260915-5-b633c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-5-b633c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1a7d9807", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:51:00", "text": "Good point, Bob. We should also address the closed ecosystem approach in the design section. Maybe suggest a more open architecture to enhance flexibility? 🔄", "utterranceID": "20260915-6-0851a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-6-0851a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9db3abf4", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:56:00", "text": "For the UI, let's add a subsection on user feedback incorporation. We need to make sure the design is intuitive for non-technical users. Perhaps more user-friendly features or customization options? 🖥️", "utterranceID": "20260915-7-0eb18"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-7-0eb18"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_caa2e58d", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:57:00", "text": "And for update disruptions, we should include a section on update management and rollback procedures. Ensuring backward compatibility is crucial for reliability. 🔄", "utterranceID": "20260915-8-d26b9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-8-d26b9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2d8eff4d", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:58:00", "text": "Agreed, @eid_caa2e58d. We could also emphasize the importance of thorough testing before deployment in the technical section. 🧪", "utterranceID": "20260915-9-ec3b0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-9-ec3b0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a253c65a", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:03:00", "text": "Great suggestions, everyone! Here's a quick summary: \n1. Add setup automation tools and detailed user guidance. \n2. Optimize data processing algorithms and specify hardware recommendations. \n3. Expand integration options with APIs/connectors. \n4. Enhance UI with user feedback and customization options. \n5. Improve update management and ensure backward compatibility. \nLet's start drafting these changes and reconvene next week to finalize. Thanks for the input! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260915-10-05054"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-10-05054"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a253c65a", "timestamp": "2026-09-18T04:04:00", "text": "Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_ef_aix_technical_specifications_document|Technical Specifications Document>, thank you everyone!", "utterranceID": "20260917-0-57ecd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260917-0-57ecd"}

