{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2026-12-27T16:04:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_2347b567! Next, we have an 'Inconsistent Model Serialization' issue, also in the Model Management & Update Module. This is causing unexpected behavior when models are deserialized on edge devices, impacting CUST-0114. @eid_2347b567, this one's for you too.", "utterranceID": "20261227-3-51480"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261227-3-51480"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2026-12-27T16:07:00", "text": "Understood, I'll handle the serialization inconsistencies as well. It's important we maintain trust in our predictions. I'll keep you posted on my progress. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261227-4-098c0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261227-4-098c0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2026-12-27T16:08:00", "text": "Great, thanks for taking both of those on! Lastly, we have an 'Inadequate Thermal Management' issue. This is causing EdgeForce devices to overheat, leading to throttling of the AI Processing Engine. It's impacting real-time data processing for CUST-0095. @eid_bac7c6c4, can you address this?", "utterranceID": "20261227-5-b6176"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261227-5-b6176"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2026-12-27T16:13:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll dive into the thermal management issue. Ensuring our devices run smoothly under all conditions is key. I'll start by reviewing the current thermal management protocols. 🔥", "utterranceID": "20261227-6-08fd8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261227-6-08fd8"}
