{"Channel": {"name": "planning-LeadQualification", "channelID": "ch-ation-f9a7af"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_66d09012", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T14:09:00", "text": "Hi team, I want to discuss the Product Requirements Document for LeadQualification. Let's brainstorm some ideas and outline the key sections we need to include. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260403-0-b1319"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260403-0-b1319"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-LeadQualification", "channelID": "ch-ation-f9a7af"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T14:10:16", "text": "@here Stay updated with this news article on the latest trends in AI-driven lead qualification. It highlights key industry shifts and emerging technologies. https://www.forbes.com/sites/forbestechcouncil/2023/09/15/the-future-of-ai-in-lead-qualification/", "utterranceID": "20260403-33-19c9c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260403-33-19c9c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-LeadQualification", "channelID": "ch-ation-f9a7af"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T14:13:00", "text": "Hey @eid_66d09012, sounds good! I think we should start with a clear problem statement and the objectives of LeadQualification. What do you all think?", "utterranceID": "20260403-1-c1331"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260403-1-c1331"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-LeadQualification", "channelID": "ch-ation-f9a7af"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_59bbe6f6", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T14:14:00", "text": "Agreed, George M. We should also include user personas to understand who will benefit most from our AI-powered lead scoring. @eid_66d09012, do we have any existing data on this?", "utterranceID": "20260403-2-04b81"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260403-2-04b81"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-LeadQualification", "channelID": "ch-ation-f9a7af"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_66d09012", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T14:19:00", "text": "Great point, Charlie S! We have some initial data from past projects that we can leverage. I'll compile that and share it here by tomorrow. 📊", "utterranceID": "20260403-3-55374"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260403-3-55374"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-LeadQualification", "channelID": "ch-ation-f9a7af"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T14:24:00", "text": "For the technical section, we should outline the AI models we'll use and how they'll integrate with existing systems. @eid_ee9ca887, any thoughts on this?", "utterranceID": "20260403-4-2dbc8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260403-4-2dbc8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-LeadQualification", "channelID": "ch-ation-f9a7af"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T14:27:00", "text": "Absolutely, Julia G. We can use a mix of supervised learning models and real-time data processing. I'll draft a technical overview by Friday. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260403-5-f538f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260403-5-f538f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-LeadQualification", "channelID": "ch-ation-f9a7af"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31ca5b45", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T14:30:00", "text": "Don't forget about the testing strategy! We need to ensure the system is reliable and accurate. I'll start drafting the QA section. @eid_4de5cd7f, can you help with this?", "utterranceID": "20260403-6-46ab7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260403-6-46ab7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-LeadQualification", "channelID": "ch-ation-f9a7af"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4de5cd7f", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T14:34:00", "text": "Sure thing, Fiona! I'll focus on the test cases for different lead scenarios. Let's aim to have a draft by next week. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260403-7-b2d49"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260403-7-b2d49"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-LeadQualification", "channelID": "ch-ation-f9a7af"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_85a4de81", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T14:36:00", "text": "What about the user interface? We need to make sure it's intuitive for sales teams to use. @eid_59bbe6f6, any insights from your UX research?", "utterranceID": "20260403-8-77bd3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260403-8-77bd3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-LeadQualification", "channelID": "ch-ation-f9a7af"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_59bbe6f6", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T14:40:00", "text": "Yes, Julia D! Based on our research, a dashboard with clear visualizations of lead scores and engagement patterns would be ideal. I'll mock up some designs by Monday. 🎨", "utterranceID": "20260403-9-6a533"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260403-9-6a533"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-LeadQualification", "channelID": "ch-ation-f9a7af"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_50da4819", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T14:43:00", "text": "Sounds like we're on the right track! Let's set a deadline for the first draft of the PRD. How about we aim for the end of next week?", "utterranceID": "20260403-10-73bf6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260403-10-73bf6"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a23a73c4", "timestamp": "2026-11-25T18:29:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll start by reviewing the export logs and ensure we encrypt sensitive data. Thanks for flagging this! 🔒", "utterranceID": "20261125-4-78c32"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261125-4-78c32"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-11-25T18:31:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_a23a73c4! Lastly, we have an 'Algorithm Overfitting on Historical Data' issue. Our AI model is overfitting, leading to poor generalization and inaccurate scoring for new leads. This is impacting Customer CUST-0006. @eid_90359c89, can you take this one on? The affected area is the AI Scoring Algorithm.", "utterranceID": "20261125-5-2d8d5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261125-5-2d8d5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_90359c89", "timestamp": "2026-11-25T18:36:00", "text": "On it! I'll review the model and adjust the training process to improve generalization. Thanks for the update! 🤖", "utterranceID": "20261125-6-759d1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261125-6-759d1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-11-25T18:38:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks everyone for jumping on these so quickly! Let's keep the communication open if you need any help or run into any roadblocks. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261125-7-e76d4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261125-7-e76d4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a43a4389", "timestamp": "2026-11-25T18:39:00", "text": "Will do! If anyone has insights on recent changes to the database system, let me know. It might help with the sync issue. 🤔", "utterranceID": "20261125-8-fd47c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261125-8-fd47c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a23a73c4", "timestamp": "2026-11-25T18:41:00", "text": "I'll check with the security team to see if there are any recent updates on data handling policies. 🔍", "utterranceID": "20261125-9-d773e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261125-9-d773e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_90359c89", "timestamp": "2026-11-25T18:45:00", "text": "I'll reach out to the data science team for any recent model updates that might have caused the overfitting. 🧠", "utterranceID": "20261125-10-d4f5f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261125-10-d4f5f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-11-25T18:49:00", "text": "Perfect, thanks for the proactive approach, everyone! Let's aim to have updates by the end of the week. 💪", "utterranceID": "20261125-11-131f2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261125-11-131f2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-11-26T21:35:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that might give us insights into our current issues. Let's take a look! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261126-0-22f67"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261126-0-22f67"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-11-26T21:37:00", "text": "First up, we have a bug in PostgreSQL titled 'Inconsistent Data Replication'. It deals with replication lag causing data discrepancies between primary and standby databases. Sounds familiar, right? Here's the PR link: https://github.com/postgres/postgres/pull/633. @eid_a43a4389, Fiona, this might be useful for the sync issue you're tackling.", "utterranceID": "20261126-1-cf123"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261126-1-cf123"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a43a4389", "timestamp": "2026-11-26T21:39:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian! This is super relevant. I'll review their approach to handling replication lag and see if we can apply similar strategies to our database management system. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261126-2-13b2b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261126-2-13b2b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-11-26T21:44:00", "text": "Next, there's a bug in Apache Kafka titled 'Plaintext Logging of Sensitive Data'. It highlights the risk of logging sensitive info in plaintext, which is a security concern. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/634. Bob, this seems related to the data leakage issue you're working on.", "utterranceID": "20261126-3-37d4c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261126-3-37d4c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a23a73c4", "timestamp": "2026-11-26T21:48:00", "text": "Absolutely, Ian! I'll dive into their solution for encrypting logs and see how we can enhance our data export module. Thanks for sharing! 🔒", "utterranceID": "20261126-4-b1763"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261126-4-b1763"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-11-16T06:46:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect data types in lead attributes has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/55.", "utterranceID": "20261115-0-814e7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-0-814e7"}
