{"Channel": {"name": "develop-ianmiller-SearchFlow", "channelID": "ch-hflow-a687ca"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_95f6d01c", "timestamp": "2026-04-06T23:29:00", "text": "Emma, from what I've gathered, they recommend optimizing server resources and possibly upgrading hardware, but these aren't always feasible solutions for every team, especially smaller ones.", "utterranceID": "20260529-4-86401"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260529-4-86401"}
