{"Channel": {"name": "planning-SecurityForce", "channelID": "ch-tyaix-f76a54"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_038c9fb6", "timestamp": "2026-04-22T09:40:00", "text": "Emma, definitely! As more companies adopt GraphQL, having support for both API types ensures they can cater to a broader audience. It's a strategic move to future-proof their offering. 🔮", "utterranceID": "20260915-8-3f2cd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-8-3f2cd"}
