{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-504165"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2026-08-04T12:53:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that might help us with our current Salesforce issues. Let's take a look at them! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260804-0-36f52"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260804-0-36f52"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-504165"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2026-08-04T12:54:00", "text": "First up, we have a bug in WordPress titled 'Insecure Direct Object Reference in Media Library'. Users can manipulate URLs to access unauthorized media files, which is a security risk. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/WordPress/WordPress/pull/5196. @eid_ecaa9084, this seems similar to the export module issue you're working on.", "utterranceID": "20260804-1-baa21"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260804-1-baa21"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-504165"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ecaa9084", "timestamp": "2026-08-04T12:59:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! This is really helpful. I'll review their approach to see if we can apply similar security measures to our export module. 🔐", "utterranceID": "20260804-2-249a3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260804-2-249a3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-504165"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2026-08-04T13:01:00", "text": "Next, there's a bug in TensorFlow titled 'Inaccurate Model Predictions with Skewed Data'. It describes how models trained on skewed datasets produce unreliable predictions. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/pull/5197. Charlie, this might give us some insights for the TrendForce prediction issue.", "utterranceID": "20260804-3-f4917"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260804-3-f4917"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-504165"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_14a5889d", "timestamp": "2026-08-04T13:02:00", "text": "Great find, Julia! I'll check out their solution and see if we can adapt any techniques for handling skewed data in our algorithm. 📊", "utterranceID": "20260804-4-352ab"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260804-4-352ab"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-504165"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2026-08-04T13:05:00", "text": "Lastly, there's a bug in Apache Spark titled 'Data Processing Bottleneck with Large Datasets'. It talks about delays during data aggregation tasks. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/apache/spark/pull/5198. David, this seems relevant to the bottleneck issue you're tackling.", "utterranceID": "20260804-5-1ab45"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260804-5-1ab45"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-504165"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2542cff3", "timestamp": "2026-08-04T13:08:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! I'll dive into their PR to see how they optimized their data processing pipeline. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260804-6-c1f2d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260804-6-c1f2d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-504165"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2026-08-04T13:11:00", "text": "Awesome! Let's keep these references in mind as we work through our issues. Feel free to share any insights or strategies you find useful. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260804-7-d44ca"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260804-7-d44ca"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-504165"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_14a5889d", "timestamp": "2026-08-04T13:14:00", "text": "Will do! If anyone else has thoughts on handling data skew, I'm all ears. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260804-8-e71d8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260804-8-e71d8"}
