{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2027-02-04T05:23:00", "text": "Great, George! Next, there's a bug in Elasticsearch titled 'Data Aggregation Inconsistencies in Queries'. It involves faulty bucket calculations leading to inconsistent results. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/1968. Emma, this might be useful for the Data Aggregation Discrepancies you're handling.", "utterranceID": "20270204-3-6524e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270204-3-6524e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_88c661bc", "timestamp": "2027-02-04T05:24:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! This is super helpful. I'll dive into their PR and see how they tackled the aggregation logic. It might give us a clue on how to resolve our discrepancies. 💪", "utterranceID": "20270204-4-97d25"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270204-4-97d25"}
