{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8d6fe78d", "timestamp": "2027-02-04T05:26:00", "text": "Absolutely, Julia. Security is a top priority, and learning from OpenSSL's approach could be invaluable. I'll review their encryption protocols and see how we can enhance ours. 🔒", "utterranceID": "20270204-6-3cec1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270204-6-3cec1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2027-02-04T05:29:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep these references in mind as we work through our issues. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or want to discuss further. Let's get these bugs squashed! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20270204-7-53b00"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270204-7-53b00"}
