{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8d6fe78d", "timestamp": "2027-02-04T05:33:00", "text": "Thanks, team! I'll keep you posted on any progress or insights from these open-source projects. 😊", "utterranceID": "20270204-9-17caa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270204-9-17caa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2542cff3", "timestamp": "2027-02-08T15:33:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect token expiry, titled 'Token Expiry Mismatch', has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ContextForce/pull/37.", "utterranceID": "20270208-0-88f88"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270208-0-88f88"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8d6fe78d", "timestamp": "2027-02-08T15:38:00", "text": "Great news, David! Can you explain what was causing the issue?", "utterranceID": "20270208-1-1f57b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270208-1-1f57b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2542cff3", "timestamp": "2027-02-08T15:43:00", "text": "Sure, George. The root cause was a misconfiguration in the token expiry settings within our API Authentication Module. Tokens were set to expire sooner than intended, which led to frequent re-authentication requests for third-party applications.", "utterranceID": "20270208-2-ab4a1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270208-2-ab4a1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2027-02-08T15:44:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, David. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270208-3-7a930"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270208-3-7a930"}

