{"title": "Implement Data Structures for Lead Scoring", "summary": "Design and implement data structures to store engagement history, demographic data, and predictive scores for leads.", "link": "https://github.com/salesforce/AIX/pull/1", "mergeable": "True", "merged": "False", "number": "1", "state": "open", "user": {"login": "eid_f98d7490"}, "created_at": "2026-05-02T03:15:00", "reviews": [{"state": "APPROVED", "user": {"login": "eid_c39dc658"}, "comment": "The data structures for engagement history look solid and should be efficient for retrieval. The predictive scores approach seems scalable, and the calculations are clear. LGTM, approved! 🚀", "submitted_at": "2026-05-02T13:41:00"}, {"state": "PENDING", "user": {"login": "eid_3f4b2681"}, "comment": "The demographic data structure is flexible and should support various lead attributes well. I ran the unit tests, and everything passed smoothly, ensuring data integrity and correctness. Same here, LGTM! Approved! 🎉", "submitted_at": "2026-05-02T13:42:00"}], "id": "github_com_salesforce_AIX_pull_1"}

