{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-10-30T09:12:00", "text": "Sure, @eid_802e8eff. The backend server processes sentiment data using a default time zone setting. This is actually the expected behavior, as the system is designed to standardize data processing across different regions.", "utterranceID": "20261030-2-ee25c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-2-ee25c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-30T09:15:00", "text": "So, the time zone setting is intentional to ensure consistency in data processing?", "utterranceID": "20261030-3-8b0fa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-3-8b0fa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-10-30T09:16:00", "text": "Exactly, Charlie. The default time zone setting ensures that all sentiment data is processed uniformly, regardless of the user's local time zone. This prevents discrepancies when comparing data from different regions.", "utterranceID": "20261030-4-30a75"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-4-30a75"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-30T09:19:00", "text": "Got it. So, it's more of a user misunderstanding rather than a bug. Did you take any steps to verify this?", "utterranceID": "20261030-5-d1c6a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-5-d1c6a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-10-30T09:21:00", "text": "Yes, I reviewed the server configuration and confirmed that the time zone setting is as intended. I also checked with the product team to ensure this aligns with our design specifications.", "utterranceID": "20261030-6-f8bd9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-6-f8bd9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-30T09:22:00", "text": "Thanks for clarifying, David. Maybe we should update the user documentation to explain this behavior?", "utterranceID": "20261030-7-02865"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-7-02865"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-10-30T09:23:00", "text": "Good idea, Charlie. I'll coordinate with the documentation team to add a note about the time zone settings and their purpose.", "utterranceID": "20261030-8-30011"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-8-30011"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-30T09:26:00", "text": "Thanks, David. That should help clear up any future confusion.", "utterranceID": "20261030-9-8c61c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-9-8c61c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T22:19:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) vulnerability on the login page.", "utterranceID": "20261102-0-711ef"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-0-711ef"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T22:20:00", "text": "After a thorough review, I've determined that this does not require a fix.", "utterranceID": "20261102-1-c6d15"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-1-c6d15"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T22:23:00", "text": "@eid_6cc1a0f6 Could you explain why it's not a concern? XSS sounds pretty serious.", "utterranceID": "20261102-2-07718"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-2-07718"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T22:24:00", "text": "Absolutely, David. The reported XSS vulnerability is actually a result of a misconfiguration in the testing environment.", "utterranceID": "20261102-3-86c8e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-3-86c8e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T22:27:00", "text": "In our production environment, input sanitization and output encoding are correctly implemented, preventing any script injection.", "utterranceID": "20261102-4-4e853"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-4-4e853"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-06T18:03:00", "text": "Sure, @eid_13cb0e90. The issue stems from the fact that the indexes were designed for a different set of queries and data patterns.", "utterranceID": "20260906-4-c4e92"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-4-c4e92"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-06T18:06:00", "text": "The current behavior is expected given the current index design. It's not a system error but rather a case of misaligned expectations.", "utterranceID": "20260906-5-2331c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-5-2331c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-06T18:11:00", "text": "So, it's more about how the indexes were initially set up rather than a bug in the system?", "utterranceID": "20260906-6-66445"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-6-66445"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-06T18:13:00", "text": "Exactly, Emma. I also checked the index maintenance logs, and they show that the indexes are being maintained as per the original design.", "utterranceID": "20260906-7-b10a4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-7-b10a4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-09-06T18:18:00", "text": "Thanks for clarifying, Bob. So, no changes needed on our end?", "utterranceID": "20260906-8-4d433"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-8-4d433"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-06T18:22:00", "text": "That's right, @eid_8658e19c. No changes are needed unless we decide to redesign the indexes to better suit the current query patterns.", "utterranceID": "20260906-9-bcfce"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-9-bcfce"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-09-06T18:25:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Bob. Let's keep an eye on the query performance and revisit if necessary.", "utterranceID": "20260906-10-183a9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-10-183a9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-06T18:30:00", "text": "Will do, Julia. I'll monitor the situation and let you all know if anything changes.", "utterranceID": "20260906-11-e8a8e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-11-e8a8e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-09-13T00:44:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the weak password policy enforcement. The concern was that our system allows users to set weak passwords, potentially making it easier for brute force attacks.", "utterranceID": "20260912-0-ed551"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260912-0-ed551"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-09-13T00:49:00", "text": "After reviewing the system configuration and policies, I found that this is actually expected behavior. Our current setup is designed to allow flexibility for users who prefer simpler passwords, as long as they are aware of the risks.", "utterranceID": "20260912-1-6129b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260912-1-6129b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-13T00:54:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Ian. So, there's no need for a fix because it's a user choice issue?", "utterranceID": "20260912-2-1ca49"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260912-2-1ca49"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-09-13T00:59:00", "text": "Exactly, Bob. We provide users with the option to set stronger passwords, and we also have additional security measures in place, like two-factor authentication, to mitigate potential risks.", "utterranceID": "20260912-3-279e6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260912-3-279e6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-09-13T01:01:00", "text": "That makes sense. Did you check if there were any misconfigurations that might have led to this report?", "utterranceID": "20260912-4-20c25"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260912-4-20c25"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-09-13T01:03:00", "text": "Yes, Julia. I verified the configurations and everything is set up as intended. The report seems to stem from a misunderstanding of our policy flexibility rather than a technical issue.", "utterranceID": "20260912-5-ae0da"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260912-5-ae0da"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-13T01:08:00", "text": "Good to know, Ian. Should we consider updating our documentation to make this clearer to users?", "utterranceID": "20260912-6-e2dfd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260912-6-e2dfd"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-10-03T00:14:00", "text": "Awesome! Let's leverage these insights to improve our solutions. If you need any more info or run into issues, just ping me. Let's keep up the great work, team! 💪", "utterranceID": "20261002-7-66b65"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-7-66b65"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-10-03T00:15:00", "text": "Will do, thanks for the resources, Emma! It's always helpful to learn from the open-source community. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261002-8-17fca"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-8-17fca"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-03T00:16:00", "text": "Absolutely, thanks for coordinating, Emma! Let's get these issues sorted out. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261002-9-b432b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-9-b432b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:40:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Inefficient Query Execution Plan' has been resolved. You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/39.", "utterranceID": "20261006-0-953d7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-0-953d7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:42:00", "text": "The root cause was due to a lack of updated statistics and missing query optimization hints, which led to the database generating suboptimal execution plans for retrieving sentiment data.", "utterranceID": "20261006-1-6de80"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-1-6de80"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:47:00", "text": "To fix this, I updated the statistics on the relevant tables and added specific query optimization hints to guide the database management system towards more efficient execution paths.", "utterranceID": "20261006-2-455fb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-2-455fb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:51:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_fa6ec727! This should help improve the query processing times significantly.", "utterranceID": "20261006-3-f16c0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-3-f16c0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:53:00", "text": "Thanks, Fiona! This was a critical issue, and I'm glad it's resolved. I'll run some tests to ensure everything is working smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20261006-4-ebb1b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-4-ebb1b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:55:00", "text": "Thanks, Bob and Emma! Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing. I'm here to help.", "utterranceID": "20261006-5-f96d0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-5-f96d0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:56:00", "text": "Will do, Fiona. Thanks again for the quick turnaround on this!", "utterranceID": "20261006-6-c5cec"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-6-c5cec"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T01:44:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the security vulnerability in the user authentication module.", "utterranceID": "20261008-0-ffc40"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-0-ffc40"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T01:48:00", "text": "The concern was that a flaw allows unauthorized access to sentiment analysis reports, which could risk data privacy.", "utterranceID": "20261008-1-05881"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-1-05881"}
