{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T02:07:00", "text": "I also checked with the team responsible for user roles, and they are addressing the configuration to prevent any further misunderstandings.", "utterranceID": "20261008-8-90207"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-8-90207"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T02:10:00", "text": "Thanks for clarifying, Fiona. Good to know it's not a security flaw in our system.", "utterranceID": "20261008-9-a5e58"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-9-a5e58"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T02:13:00", "text": "Thanks, Fiona. I'll make sure to communicate this to the client so they can adjust their configurations.", "utterranceID": "20261008-10-074c2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-10-074c2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T02:18:00", "text": "No problem, happy to help! Let me know if there's anything else you need from my side.", "utterranceID": "20261008-11-5785f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-11-5785f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-10-11T12:26:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the sentiment analysis engine misinterpreting certain emojis, specifically the 'smiling face with smiling eyes' emoji being read as negative.", "utterranceID": "20261011-0-8279d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261011-0-8279d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-10-11T12:31:00", "text": "After reviewing the bug, I've determined that it does not require a fix. The sentiment analysis algorithm is functioning as designed.", "utterranceID": "20261011-1-70eb9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261011-1-70eb9"}
