{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bb46d667", "timestamp": "2026-06-25T14:02:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Inefficient UI State Management' has been resolved. You can check out the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ConnectForce/pull/25.", "utterranceID": "20260625-0-95e73"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260625-0-95e73"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bb46d667", "timestamp": "2026-06-25T14:03:00", "text": "The root cause was due to poor state management practices. Specifically, the application was trying to update all UI components simultaneously when users switched between integration tasks, which led to sluggish performance.", "utterranceID": "20260625-1-08cfc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260625-1-08cfc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bb46d667", "timestamp": "2026-06-25T14:06:00", "text": "To fix this, I implemented a more efficient state management strategy by using a debouncing mechanism. This allows the application to batch updates and only refresh the necessary components, significantly improving the UI responsiveness.", "utterranceID": "20260625-2-65b16"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260625-2-65b16"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f12eccf0", "timestamp": "2026-06-25T14:09:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_bb46d667! Thanks for tackling this. The sluggish UI was a major pain point.", "utterranceID": "20260625-3-46df3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260625-3-46df3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86205170", "timestamp": "2026-06-25T14:14:00", "text": "Thanks, Bob! This should make a big difference for our users. I'll test it out and let you know if I spot anything.", "utterranceID": "20260625-4-80a4c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260625-4-80a4c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2977e519", "timestamp": "2026-06-25T14:16:00", "text": "Awesome job, Bob! The debouncing mechanism sounds like a smart solution. I'll update the documentation to reflect these changes.", "utterranceID": "20260625-5-a864b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260625-5-a864b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bb46d667", "timestamp": "2026-06-25T14:17:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing, @Hannah Miller. And thanks, Fiona, for updating the docs!", "utterranceID": "20260625-6-f3465"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260625-6-f3465"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2977e519", "timestamp": "2026-06-27T22:29:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about improper session management has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ConnectForce/pull/26.", "utterranceID": "20260627-0-f6767"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260627-0-f6767"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2977e519", "timestamp": "2026-06-27T22:31:00", "text": "The root cause was that the session management system wasn't revoking tokens upon user logout, which left sessions open to hijacking.", "utterranceID": "20260627-1-bdea0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260627-1-bdea0"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-07-11T23:52:00", "text": "Great! Next, we have a 'Use of Deprecated Encryption Algorithms' issue in OpenSSL. This is about outdated encryption posing security risks, just like our 'Weak Encryption Algorithms' issue. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/openssl/openssl/pull/1435. Ian, any thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20260711-3-908a5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260711-3-908a5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-07-11T23:54:00", "text": "This is spot on, Alice! I'll dive into the OpenSSL PR to see how they updated their encryption algorithms. It could help us ensure our AI Connector is secure. 🔒", "utterranceID": "20260711-4-df3f8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260711-4-df3f8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-07-11T23:57:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks Ian! Lastly, there's a 'Bias in Model Training Data' issue in TensorFlow. It deals with AI models trained on biased datasets, leading to inaccurate outputs, similar to our 'Faulty AI Training Data' issue. Here's the PR: https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/pull/1436. Alice Taylor, could you take a look?", "utterranceID": "20260711-5-b7323"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260711-5-b7323"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ba9224d2", "timestamp": "2026-07-12T00:00:00", "text": "Absolutely, Alice! I'll check out how TensorFlow is addressing the bias in their training data. It might offer some strategies we can apply to our AI models. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260711-6-eb368"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260711-6-eb368"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-07-12T00:04:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's use these insights to enhance our solutions. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or want to discuss further. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20260711-7-167c4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260711-7-167c4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-07-12T00:08:00", "text": "Will do! Let's leverage these examples to improve our products. 💪", "utterranceID": "20260711-8-84526"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260711-8-84526"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ba9224d2", "timestamp": "2026-07-12T00:12:00", "text": "Absolutely, let's make it happen! 💼", "utterranceID": "20260711-9-169ce"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260711-9-169ce"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-07-14T16:00:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the AI Connector failing to adapt to changes in the source schema, titled 'Schema Evolution Misinterpretation'.", "utterranceID": "20260714-0-7437a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260714-0-7437a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-07-14T16:04:00", "text": "After reviewing the details, I've determined that this does not require a fix. The behavior is actually expected due to the current design of the AI model.", "utterranceID": "20260714-1-39f14"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260714-1-39f14"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-07-14T16:05:00", "text": "Can you elaborate on why it's expected, Charlie?", "utterranceID": "20260714-2-b9438"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260714-2-b9438"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-07-14T16:10:00", "text": "Sure, Alice. The AI Connector is designed to work with static schema mappings. It's not intended to dynamically adjust to schema changes without manual intervention.", "utterranceID": "20260714-3-284fa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260714-3-284fa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc0f17c3", "timestamp": "2026-07-14T16:11:00", "text": "So, it's more of a configuration issue rather than a bug?", "utterranceID": "20260714-4-c7d0c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260714-4-c7d0c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-07-14T16:12:00", "text": "Exactly, Fiona. Users need to update the mappings manually whenever there's a schema change. This was outlined in the initial design documentation.", "utterranceID": "20260714-5-e2b5a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260714-5-e2b5a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-07-14T16:14:00", "text": "Got it. Did you take any steps to verify this, Charlie?", "utterranceID": "20260714-6-06440"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260714-6-06440"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-07-04T09:43:00", "text": "First up, we have a bug in Apache Kafka related to 'Schema Registry Compatibility Issues'. It seems the Schema Registry isn't handling schema evolution correctly, causing data serialization errors. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/1430. @eid_d0d918f1, this sounds similar to our Schema Evolution Misinterpretation issue. What do you think?", "utterranceID": "20260704-1-5afc2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-1-5afc2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-07-04T09:46:00", "text": "Thanks, Alice! This does sound quite similar to what we're seeing with the AI Connector. I'll review the PR and see if there are any strategies we can apply to our Data Mapping Engine. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260704-2-53443"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-2-53443"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-07-04T09:49:00", "text": "Great! Next, there's a React issue titled 'High Memory Usage in Component Rendering'. Certain components are consuming too much memory during rendering, which is degrading performance in large applications. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/facebook/react/pull/1431. Fiona, this seems to align with the memory usage issue in our UI components. Thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20260704-3-7e181"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-3-7e181"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc0f17c3", "timestamp": "2026-07-04T09:50:00", "text": "Absolutely, Alice! This React issue could provide some valuable insights. I'll dive into the PR and see if there are any optimizations we can leverage for our UI components. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260704-4-dea3c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-4-dea3c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-07-04T09:55:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks Fiona! Lastly, there's a Keycloak bug about an 'Unsupported Authentication Protocol'. Keycloak is failing to authenticate with certain identity providers due to missing protocol support. Here's the PR: https://github.com/keycloak/keycloak/pull/1432. Fiona, since you're already looking into our authentication issue, could you also check this one out?", "utterranceID": "20260704-5-f3126"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-5-f3126"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc0f17c3", "timestamp": "2026-07-04T10:00:00", "text": "Sure thing, Alice! I'll review the Keycloak PR and see if there are any solutions we can apply to our Authentication Module. Let's ensure smooth connections for our customers! 🔑", "utterranceID": "20260704-6-5a404"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-6-5a404"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-07-04T10:05:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep each other updated on any findings or strategies we can implement. Feel free to reach out if you need more info or support. Let's get these resolved! 💪", "utterranceID": "20260704-7-00d3c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-7-00d3c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-07-04T10:09:00", "text": "Will do, Alice! I'll keep you posted on any progress with the schema issue. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260704-8-075e3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-8-075e3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc0f17c3", "timestamp": "2026-07-04T10:14:00", "text": "Same here, I'll update you on both the memory and authentication issues. Thanks for coordinating, Alice!", "utterranceID": "20260704-9-4cc88"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-9-4cc88"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-07-09T10:44:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with our ConnectForce product. Let's go through them and assign tasks. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260709-0-ead71"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260709-0-ead71"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ba9224d2", "timestamp": "2026-09-21T23:57:00", "text": "The root cause was that the cache invalidation mechanism wasn't triggering correctly when data sources were updated. This led to unnecessary data fetching and processing.", "utterranceID": "20260921-2-55ce9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-2-55ce9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ba9224d2", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T00:02:00", "text": "I've fixed this by ensuring that the cache invalidation logic now correctly listens to data source update events and invalidates the cache immediately. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ConnectForce/pull/35", "utterranceID": "20260921-3-c7310"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-3-c7310"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T00:06:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_ba9224d2! Thanks for resolving this so quickly. I'll review the PR shortly.", "utterranceID": "20260921-4-4064e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-4-4064e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T00:08:00", "text": "Thanks, Alice Taylor! This should help improve the system's performance significantly. Let me know if you need any help with testing.", "utterranceID": "20260921-5-55d80"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-5-55d80"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ba9224d2", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T00:10:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_294ba09d and Ian! Feel free to reach out if you have any questions during the review. Testing help would be great, Ian. I'll ping you once the PR is merged.", "utterranceID": "20260921-6-c14dd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-6-c14dd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T00:13:00", "text": "Sounds good, Alice Taylor. I'll get on the review now.", "utterranceID": "20260921-7-71f62"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-7-71f62"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T09:02:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about improper authentication in API requests has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ConnectForce/pull/36.", "utterranceID": "20260924-0-9bf1b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-0-9bf1b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T09:07:00", "text": "The root cause was a flaw in our OAuth 2.0 implementation. Tokens were being issued without proper validation, which allowed unauthorized users to access sensitive data through the API endpoints.", "utterranceID": "20260924-1-5f5c7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-1-5f5c7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T09:12:00", "text": "To fix this, I updated the token validation process to ensure that each token is verified against our user database before being issued. This includes checking the token's signature and expiration time to prevent unauthorized access.", "utterranceID": "20260924-2-5611b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-2-5611b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T09:15:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_d098d618! Thanks for addressing this so quickly. I'll make sure to update the documentation to reflect these changes.", "utterranceID": "20260924-3-dcc16"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-3-dcc16"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ba9224d2", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T09:20:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian. This was a critical fix. I'll run some additional tests to make sure everything is working as expected.", "utterranceID": "20260924-4-6bae2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-4-6bae2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T09:23:00", "text": "Thanks, Alice and Alice! Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing. I'm here to help.", "utterranceID": "20260924-5-4ca59"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-5-4ca59"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-09-26T15:22:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Inefficient Data Parsing Logic' has been resolved. You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ConnectForce/pull/37.", "utterranceID": "20260926-0-456d6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260926-0-456d6"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ba9224d2", "timestamp": "2026-08-08T10:03:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about inconsistent data source prioritization in the AI Connector has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ConnectForce/pull/29.", "utterranceID": "20260808-0-de9d4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260808-0-de9d4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ba9224d2", "timestamp": "2026-08-08T10:05:00", "text": "The root cause was a flaw in the AI's decision-making algorithm. It was inconsistently applying the source prioritization rules, which led to conflicting data being integrated.", "utterranceID": "20260808-1-7e91a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260808-1-7e91a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ba9224d2", "timestamp": "2026-08-08T10:10:00", "text": "To fix this, I updated the algorithm to ensure it consistently follows a predefined hierarchy of data sources. This involved adding a validation step to confirm the prioritization rules are applied correctly before data integration.", "utterranceID": "20260808-2-d4fab"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260808-2-d4fab"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-08-08T10:13:00", "text": "Great work, Alice Taylor! Thanks for resolving this so quickly. I'll review the PR shortly.", "utterranceID": "20260808-3-4a6e6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260808-3-4a6e6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-08-08T10:14:00", "text": "@eid_ba9224d2 Thanks for the update, Alice. This should help reduce the data discrepancies we've been seeing.", "utterranceID": "20260808-4-ea44a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260808-4-ea44a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ba9224d2", "timestamp": "2026-08-08T10:16:00", "text": "No problem, @eid_d098d618. Let me know if you encounter any more issues or have any questions about the fix.", "utterranceID": "20260808-5-ab3d9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260808-5-ab3d9"}
