{"Channel": {"name": "develop-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-d38149"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4cede092", "timestamp": "2026-07-02T07:46:00", "text": "Great points, everyone! Next, let's look at Apache Kafka's 'Feedback Loop for Stream Processing Results'. This feature introduces a mechanism for users to provide feedback on stream processing tasks. Here's the link: https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/2132. @eid_fa6ec727, what do you think?", "utterranceID": "20260702-4-f1656"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260702-4-f1656"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-d38149"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-07-02T07:51:00", "text": "Interesting! Kafka's approach to feedback on stream processing results is more about operational feedback, which is slightly different from our user-centric focus. However, their method of collecting and processing feedback could offer some technical insights, especially in handling large volumes of feedback efficiently.", "utterranceID": "20260702-5-af2d1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260702-5-af2d1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-d38149"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4cede092", "timestamp": "2026-07-02T07:52:00", "text": "Good observation, Fiona! Finally, let's discuss TensorFlow's 'Model Output Feedback Interface'. This feature adds a UI for providing feedback on model predictions to improve training datasets. Check it out here: https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/pull/2133. @eid_fc4619fa, any thoughts on this one?", "utterranceID": "20260702-6-e1983"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260702-6-e1983"}
