{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7687dbe6", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T02:22:00", "text": "Sure, Julia. The root cause was that our CORS configuration was set to allow all origins by default. This meant that any domain could access our API, which is a security risk.", "utterranceID": "20270205-2-d9e9a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270205-2-d9e9a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e4d35074", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T02:27:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Fiona. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270205-3-ee28e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270205-3-ee28e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7687dbe6", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T02:30:00", "text": "I updated the CORS policy to validate against a list of trusted domains. Now, only requests from these domains will be allowed. This should prevent unauthorized access to customer data.", "utterranceID": "20270205-4-65b33"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270205-4-65b33"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T02:34:00", "text": "That sounds like a solid fix. Thanks for handling this so quickly, Fiona!", "utterranceID": "20270205-5-5af56"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270205-5-5af56"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e4d35074", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T02:35:00", "text": "Agreed, nice work @eid_7687dbe6. Let me know if there's anything else I can help with.", "utterranceID": "20270205-6-9a0f0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270205-6-9a0f0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7687dbe6", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T02:37:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian and Julia. I'll keep you posted if anything else comes up. For now, everything looks good!", "utterranceID": "20270205-7-4a385"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270205-7-4a385"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2027-02-19T15:24:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_2e1d6568! Lastly, there's an issue with 'Exposed Debug Information in API Responses'. This is a serious security concern as it exposes sensitive data. It's impacting customer CUST-0026. @eid_a041a433, can you also take this one since it's in the API Security & Access Control area?", "utterranceID": "20270219-5-d72cb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270219-5-d72cb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a041a433", "timestamp": "2027-02-19T15:29:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll prioritize this and ensure we secure the API responses. Thanks for flagging it. 🔒", "utterranceID": "20270219-6-98658"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270219-6-98658"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2027-02-19T15:32:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks everyone for jumping on these issues so quickly. Let's keep our customers happy! If you need any more details or run into roadblocks, just shout. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20270219-7-ed3eb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270219-7-ed3eb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2e1d6568", "timestamp": "2027-02-19T15:34:00", "text": "Will do! Let's get these sorted out. 💪", "utterranceID": "20270219-8-5fa97"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270219-8-5fa97"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a041a433", "timestamp": "2027-02-19T15:37:00", "text": "On it! Let's make sure PitchForce is running smoothly for everyone. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270219-9-07062"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270219-9-07062"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2027-02-22T04:24:00", "text": "Hi team, I found some interesting open-source bugs that might help us with our current Salesforce issues. Let's take a look at them! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270221-0-3b192"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270221-0-3b192"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2027-02-22T04:26:00", "text": "First up, there's a bug in React Native titled 'Swipe Gesture Detection Failure'. Mobile users are experiencing inconsistent swipe gesture recognition, which is similar to our 'Gesture Recognition Failures' issue. You can check it out here: https://github.com/facebook/react-native/pull/412. @eid_a041a433, does this sound familiar?", "utterranceID": "20270221-1-7d4e6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270221-1-7d4e6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a041a433", "timestamp": "2027-02-22T04:27:00", "text": "Absolutely, Julia! This React Native issue seems quite similar to what we're seeing with PitchForce. I'll review their approach and see if we can apply any of their solutions to our problem. Thanks for sharing! 👍", "utterranceID": "20270221-2-94c91"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270221-2-94c91"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2027-02-22T04:32:00", "text": "Great, Hannah! Next, there's a Redis bug titled 'Suboptimal Caching Mechanism'. It describes an inefficient caching strategy leading to increased latency, which mirrors our 'Inefficient Caching Strategy' issue. Here's the link: https://github.com/redis/redis/pull/413. Fiona, any thoughts on this?", "utterranceID": "20270221-3-e6503"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270221-3-e6503"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2e1d6568", "timestamp": "2027-02-22T04:35:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! This Redis issue is spot on with what we're facing. I'll dive into their PR to see how they tackled it and if we can adopt any of their strategies. 😊", "utterranceID": "20270221-4-387c9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270221-4-387c9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2027-02-22T04:39:00", "text": "Awesome, Fiona! Lastly, there's an Express.js bug titled 'Sensitive Debug Info in API Responses'. It involves API responses inadvertently including debug information, which is a security risk. This is very similar to our 'Exposed Debug Information in API Responses' issue. Check it out here: https://github.com/expressjs/express/pull/414. Hannah, could you take a look at this one too?", "utterranceID": "20270221-5-59330"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270221-5-59330"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e6d2ec9d", "timestamp": "2026-12-26T11:42:00", "text": "Thanks, George! I'll review the TensorFlow PR and see if there are any strategies we can apply to our AI Model & Personalization Engine. It looks like a good reference point. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261226-2-064ea"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261226-2-064ea"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2026-12-26T11:44:00", "text": "Next, there's an 'Inconsistent Data Replication' issue in PostgreSQL. They're dealing with data inconsistencies due to replication lag, which sounds a lot like our own replication issue. Here's the PR: https://github.com/postgres/postgres/pull/389. George Garcia, this might be useful for you! 🤔", "utterranceID": "20261226-3-a83d2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261226-3-a83d2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0deececb", "timestamp": "2026-12-26T11:49:00", "text": "Great find, George! I'll dive into the PostgreSQL PR and see how they addressed the replication lag. It could definitely help us with our Database Management & Data Synchronization problem. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20261226-4-8d713"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261226-4-8d713"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2026-12-26T11:54:00", "text": "Lastly, there's a 'Cache Invalidation Bug' in Redis. They're facing stale data issues due to improper cache invalidation, similar to what we're seeing. Here's the link: https://github.com/redis/redis/pull/390. Emma Smith, this might be right up your alley! 🤓", "utterranceID": "20261226-5-a020e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261226-5-a020e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_022d1fd9", "timestamp": "2026-12-26T11:58:00", "text": "Thanks, George! I'll check out the Redis PR and see if their approach to fixing cache invalidation can be applied to our situation. 🔍", "utterranceID": "20261226-6-87991"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261226-6-87991"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2026-12-26T12:03:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's use these insights to improve our solutions. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or have questions. Let's keep our momentum going! 💪", "utterranceID": "20261226-7-7596a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261226-7-7596a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e6d2ec9d", "timestamp": "2026-12-26T12:04:00", "text": "Will do! Thanks for the resources, George. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261226-8-144cc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261226-8-144cc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0deececb", "timestamp": "2026-12-26T12:05:00", "text": "Thanks, George! Let's get these issues sorted. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261226-9-3efac"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261226-9-3efac"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_022d1fd9", "timestamp": "2026-12-26T12:07:00", "text": "Thanks for the support, team! Let's keep the momentum going. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261226-10-7c1cc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261226-10-7c1cc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0deececb", "timestamp": "2027-01-07T02:19:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Database Query Bottleneck' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/PitchForce/pull/45.", "utterranceID": "20270107-0-81e1c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270107-0-81e1c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0deececb", "timestamp": "2027-01-07T02:22:00", "text": "The root cause was poorly optimized SQL queries that weren't effectively using indexing, which led to slow data retrieval times, especially with large customer profiles.", "utterranceID": "20270107-1-7a99d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270107-1-7a99d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0deececb", "timestamp": "2027-01-07T02:24:00", "text": "To fix this, I restructured the SQL queries to make better use of existing indexes and added a few new indexes where necessary. This has significantly improved the query execution time.", "utterranceID": "20270107-2-ce8e2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270107-2-ce8e2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e6d2ec9d", "timestamp": "2027-01-07T02:28:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_0deececb! This should really help with the sales pitch generation delays we've been experiencing.", "utterranceID": "20270107-3-f5997"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270107-3-f5997"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2027-01-07T02:29:00", "text": "Thanks, George Garcia! I was just about to start on a workaround, but it looks like I won't need to now.", "utterranceID": "20270107-4-f3d78"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270107-4-f3d78"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_81582c30", "timestamp": "2027-01-07T02:34:00", "text": "Awesome! Thanks for the quick turnaround, George. I'll test it out with some large profiles and let you know if I encounter any issues.", "utterranceID": "20270107-5-e1a69"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270107-5-e1a69"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0deececb", "timestamp": "2027-01-07T02:39:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let me know if you run into any more issues. Happy to help!", "utterranceID": "20270107-6-e6595"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270107-6-e6595"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e6d2ec9d", "timestamp": "2027-01-19T07:10:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Touch Input Lag on Mobile Devices' has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/PitchForce/pull/46.", "utterranceID": "20270118-0-ee34c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270118-0-ee34c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0deececb", "timestamp": "2027-01-19T07:14:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_e6d2ec9d! Can you explain what was causing the lag?", "utterranceID": "20270118-1-bddb7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270118-1-bddb7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e6d2ec9d", "timestamp": "2027-01-19T07:18:00", "text": "Sure thing, George. The lag was due to inefficient event handling in our JavaScript code. Specifically, the touch events weren't optimized for mobile performance, which led to delayed response times.", "utterranceID": "20270118-2-7d2db"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270118-2-7d2db"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2027-01-19T07:19:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Emma. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270118-3-2b3c1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270118-3-2b3c1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e6d2ec9d", "timestamp": "2027-01-19T07:24:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I refactored the event handling logic to use passive event listeners. This reduces the delay by allowing the browser to handle touch events more efficiently. Additionally, I optimized the debounce function to ensure smoother interactions with touch elements.", "utterranceID": "20270118-4-918b9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270118-4-918b9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_81582c30", "timestamp": "2027-01-19T07:26:00", "text": "Awesome work, Emma! This should really improve the user experience on mobile devices.", "utterranceID": "20270118-5-dd154"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270118-5-dd154"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0deececb", "timestamp": "2027-01-19T07:29:00", "text": "Agreed, @eid_e6d2ec9d. Thanks for tackling this so quickly!", "utterranceID": "20270118-6-c8af9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270118-6-c8af9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e6d2ec9d", "timestamp": "2027-01-19T07:33:00", "text": "No problem, George. I'm glad we could get this sorted out. Let me know if you notice any other issues!", "utterranceID": "20270118-7-b620b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270118-7-b620b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_81582c30", "timestamp": "2027-01-21T14:37:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect API rate limiting has been resolved. 🎉", "utterranceID": "20270121-0-d9c9d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270121-0-d9c9d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_81582c30", "timestamp": "2027-01-21T14:39:00", "text": "The issue was due to misconfigured rate limiting rules in the API gateway, which were too restrictive and caused legitimate requests to be throttled even during normal usage.", "utterranceID": "20270121-1-bac6d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270121-1-bac6d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_81582c30", "timestamp": "2027-01-21T14:40:00", "text": "I've adjusted the rate limiting thresholds to better align with our typical traffic patterns. This should prevent unnecessary throttling while still protecting against abuse.", "utterranceID": "20270121-2-2545e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270121-2-2545e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_81582c30", "timestamp": "2027-01-21T14:44:00", "text": "You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/PitchForce/pull/47", "utterranceID": "20270121-3-ac0ef"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270121-3-ac0ef"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0deececb", "timestamp": "2027-01-21T14:49:00", "text": "Great work, Alice! Thanks for jumping on this so quickly.", "utterranceID": "20270121-4-590a3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270121-4-590a3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e6d2ec9d", "timestamp": "2027-01-21T14:54:00", "text": "@eid_81582c30 Thanks, Alice! This should improve the user experience significantly.", "utterranceID": "20270121-5-6f7be"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270121-5-6f7be"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2027-01-21T14:56:00", "text": "Nice job, Alice. I'll monitor the API performance over the next few days to ensure everything is stable.", "utterranceID": "20270121-6-a87a6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270121-6-a87a6"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T01:33:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that might give us insights into our current issues with PitchForce. Let's take a look! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261210-0-35f1f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-0-35f1f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T01:35:00", "text": "First up, we have a bug in PostgreSQL titled 'Query Performance Degradation with Large Datasets'. It seems inefficient query execution plans are causing delays with large tables, similar to our 'Database Query Bottleneck'. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/postgres/postgres/pull/384. @eid_0deececb, this might be useful for your work!", "utterranceID": "20261210-1-ca07c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-1-ca07c"}
