{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-06T18:03:00", "text": "Sure, @eid_13cb0e90. The issue stems from the fact that the indexes were designed for a different set of queries and data patterns.", "utterranceID": "20260906-4-c4e92"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-4-c4e92"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-06T18:06:00", "text": "The current behavior is expected given the current index design. It's not a system error but rather a case of misaligned expectations.", "utterranceID": "20260906-5-2331c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-5-2331c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-06T18:11:00", "text": "So, it's more about how the indexes were initially set up rather than a bug in the system?", "utterranceID": "20260906-6-66445"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-6-66445"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-06T18:13:00", "text": "Exactly, Emma. I also checked the index maintenance logs, and they show that the indexes are being maintained as per the original design.", "utterranceID": "20260906-7-b10a4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-7-b10a4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-09-06T18:18:00", "text": "Thanks for clarifying, Bob. So, no changes needed on our end?", "utterranceID": "20260906-8-4d433"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-8-4d433"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-06T18:22:00", "text": "That's right, @eid_8658e19c. No changes are needed unless we decide to redesign the indexes to better suit the current query patterns.", "utterranceID": "20260906-9-bcfce"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-9-bcfce"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-09-06T18:25:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Bob. Let's keep an eye on the query performance and revisit if necessary.", "utterranceID": "20260906-10-183a9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-10-183a9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-06T18:30:00", "text": "Will do, Julia. I'll monitor the situation and let you all know if anything changes.", "utterranceID": "20260906-11-e8a8e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-11-e8a8e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-09-13T00:44:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the weak password policy enforcement. The concern was that our system allows users to set weak passwords, potentially making it easier for brute force attacks.", "utterranceID": "20260912-0-ed551"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260912-0-ed551"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-09-13T00:49:00", "text": "After reviewing the system configuration and policies, I found that this is actually expected behavior. Our current setup is designed to allow flexibility for users who prefer simpler passwords, as long as they are aware of the risks.", "utterranceID": "20260912-1-6129b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260912-1-6129b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-13T00:54:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Ian. So, there's no need for a fix because it's a user choice issue?", "utterranceID": "20260912-2-1ca49"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260912-2-1ca49"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-09-13T00:59:00", "text": "Exactly, Bob. We provide users with the option to set stronger passwords, and we also have additional security measures in place, like two-factor authentication, to mitigate potential risks.", "utterranceID": "20260912-3-279e6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260912-3-279e6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-09-13T01:01:00", "text": "That makes sense. Did you check if there were any misconfigurations that might have led to this report?", "utterranceID": "20260912-4-20c25"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260912-4-20c25"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-09-13T01:03:00", "text": "Yes, Julia. I verified the configurations and everything is set up as intended. The report seems to stem from a misunderstanding of our policy flexibility rather than a technical issue.", "utterranceID": "20260912-5-ae0da"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260912-5-ae0da"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-13T01:08:00", "text": "Good to know, Ian. Should we consider updating our documentation to make this clearer to users?", "utterranceID": "20260912-6-e2dfd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260912-6-e2dfd"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T18:03:00", "text": "First up, we have a PostgreSQL issue titled 'Database Locking Causes System Slowdown'. It deals with heavy locking during concurrent transactions, leading to performance degradation. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/postgres/postgres/pull/159. @eid_4df5d4b7, this seems quite similar to the database locking issue you're working on. Thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20260917-1-30cfc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260917-1-30cfc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T18:08:00", "text": "Thanks, Emma! This is definitely relevant. The PostgreSQL team has some interesting approaches to managing locks that we might be able to adapt. I'll dive into their PR and see what we can learn. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260917-2-8883b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260917-2-8883b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T18:12:00", "text": "Great, Bob! Next, there's an Apache Kafka issue titled 'Real-Time Processing Lag'. It describes delays in message processing under high throughput conditions, which sounds a lot like our real-time processing lag. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/160. Hannah, could you take a look at this one?", "utterranceID": "20260917-3-93677"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260917-3-93677"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92294e45", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T18:13:00", "text": "Sure thing, Emma! The Kafka team's approach to handling high throughput might give us some ideas on optimizing our sentiment analysis engine. I'll review their PR and see what strategies we can apply. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260917-4-a45eb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260917-4-a45eb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T18:15:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks Hannah! Lastly, there's a Django REST Framework issue titled 'Malformed JSON Response Parsing'. It involves incorrect handling of malformed JSON responses, leading to dropped API requests. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/encode/django-rest-framework/pull/161. Bob, since you're already on the JSON parsing issue, could you also check this out?", "utterranceID": "20260917-5-9a47e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260917-5-9a47e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T18:19:00", "text": "Absolutely, Emma! The Django REST Framework's handling of JSON parsing could provide some valuable insights. I'll compare their solution with our current approach and see if we can improve our API integration module. 💪", "utterranceID": "20260917-6-273fa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260917-6-273fa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T18:21:00", "text": "Thanks, Bob! Let's keep these insights in mind as we work on resolving our issues. Let me know if you need any more details or support. Let's get these bugs squashed for our customers! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20260917-7-d2836"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260917-7-d2836"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92294e45", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T18:26:00", "text": "Will do, thanks for coordinating, Emma! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260917-8-29569"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260917-8-29569"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T18:31:00", "text": "Thanks, team! Let's keep our customers happy! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260917-9-8adec"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260917-9-8adec"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:09:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the 'Malformed JSON Response Parsing'.", "utterranceID": "20260921-0-c43da"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-0-c43da"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:12:00", "text": "The system was encountering errors when parsing JSON responses from Slack, which was leading to dropped messages and incomplete sentiment data.", "utterranceID": "20260921-1-c727b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-1-c727b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:15:00", "text": "After reviewing the issue, I've determined that it does not require a fix.", "utterranceID": "20260921-2-72c6a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-2-72c6a"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-10-03T00:14:00", "text": "Awesome! Let's leverage these insights to improve our solutions. If you need any more info or run into issues, just ping me. Let's keep up the great work, team! 💪", "utterranceID": "20261002-7-66b65"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-7-66b65"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-10-03T00:15:00", "text": "Will do, thanks for the resources, Emma! It's always helpful to learn from the open-source community. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261002-8-17fca"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-8-17fca"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-03T00:16:00", "text": "Absolutely, thanks for coordinating, Emma! Let's get these issues sorted out. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261002-9-b432b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-9-b432b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:40:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Inefficient Query Execution Plan' has been resolved. You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/39.", "utterranceID": "20261006-0-953d7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-0-953d7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:42:00", "text": "The root cause was due to a lack of updated statistics and missing query optimization hints, which led to the database generating suboptimal execution plans for retrieving sentiment data.", "utterranceID": "20261006-1-6de80"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-1-6de80"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:47:00", "text": "To fix this, I updated the statistics on the relevant tables and added specific query optimization hints to guide the database management system towards more efficient execution paths.", "utterranceID": "20261006-2-455fb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-2-455fb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:51:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_fa6ec727! This should help improve the query processing times significantly.", "utterranceID": "20261006-3-f16c0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-3-f16c0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:53:00", "text": "Thanks, Fiona! This was a critical issue, and I'm glad it's resolved. I'll run some tests to ensure everything is working smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20261006-4-ebb1b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-4-ebb1b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:55:00", "text": "Thanks, Bob and Emma! Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing. I'm here to help.", "utterranceID": "20261006-5-f96d0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-5-f96d0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:56:00", "text": "Will do, Fiona. Thanks again for the quick turnaround on this!", "utterranceID": "20261006-6-c5cec"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-6-c5cec"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T01:44:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the security vulnerability in the user authentication module.", "utterranceID": "20261008-0-ffc40"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-0-ffc40"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T01:48:00", "text": "The concern was that a flaw allows unauthorized access to sentiment analysis reports, which could risk data privacy.", "utterranceID": "20261008-1-05881"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-1-05881"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T01:51:00", "text": "After reviewing the details, I found that this is not actually a bug that requires fixing.", "utterranceID": "20261008-2-37440"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-2-37440"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T01:52:00", "text": "Hey Fiona, could you explain why it's not a bug? It sounded serious.", "utterranceID": "20261008-3-e05e9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-3-e05e9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T01:56:00", "text": "Sure, Bob. The issue stems from a misunderstanding of how our authentication tokens are supposed to work.", "utterranceID": "20261008-4-f8949"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-4-f8949"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T01:57:00", "text": "The tokens are indeed validated and encrypted correctly. The unauthorized access was due to a misconfiguration in the user roles on the client side.", "utterranceID": "20261008-5-d5995"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-5-d5995"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T02:02:00", "text": "@eid_fa6ec727 So, it was a configuration issue rather than a code problem?", "utterranceID": "20261008-6-936bf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-6-936bf"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T02:05:00", "text": "Exactly, Emma. I verified the token handling process and confirmed that the encryption and validation are functioning as intended.", "utterranceID": "20261008-7-fa8e7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-7-fa8e7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T02:07:00", "text": "I also checked with the team responsible for user roles, and they are addressing the configuration to prevent any further misunderstandings.", "utterranceID": "20261008-8-90207"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-8-90207"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T02:10:00", "text": "Thanks for clarifying, Fiona. Good to know it's not a security flaw in our system.", "utterranceID": "20261008-9-a5e58"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-9-a5e58"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T02:13:00", "text": "Thanks, Fiona. I'll make sure to communicate this to the client so they can adjust their configurations.", "utterranceID": "20261008-10-074c2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-10-074c2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T02:18:00", "text": "No problem, happy to help! Let me know if there's anything else you need from my side.", "utterranceID": "20261008-11-5785f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-11-5785f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-10-11T12:26:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the sentiment analysis engine misinterpreting certain emojis, specifically the 'smiling face with smiling eyes' emoji being read as negative.", "utterranceID": "20261011-0-8279d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261011-0-8279d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-10-11T12:31:00", "text": "After reviewing the bug, I've determined that it does not require a fix. The sentiment analysis algorithm is functioning as designed.", "utterranceID": "20261011-1-70eb9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261011-1-70eb9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-10-11T12:35:00", "text": "The root cause is that the algorithm lacks comprehensive emoji context mapping, which can lead to misclassification. However, this is an expected limitation given the dual meanings of some emojis.", "utterranceID": "20261011-2-95371"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261011-2-95371"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-10-11T12:37:00", "text": "I verified this by cross-referencing our emoji sentiment mapping with industry standards, and it aligns with typical interpretations.", "utterranceID": "20261011-3-491c1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261011-3-491c1"}
