{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmagarcia-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f17ba0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_24dbff62", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T22:40:00", "text": "Next, there's a CSS issue in Bootstrap titled 'CSS Conflict Hiding Navbar'. This is quite similar to our 'CSS Conflict Hiding Recommendation Cards'. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap/pull/484. Bob, this might be useful for your investigation. 🖥️", "utterranceID": "20261006-3-24796"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-3-24796"}
