{"Channel": {"name": "develop-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-s-aix-1f811d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-07-05T17:10:00", "text": "Hi team, I was looking into some open-source projects to find inspiration for our lead scoring display feature. I found a few interesting PRs that might be relevant. Let's discuss them! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260705-0-0eacd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-0-0eacd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-s-aix-1f811d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-07-05T17:15:00", "text": "First up, JupyterLab has a PR for Interactive Data Visualization Widgets. It focuses on creating widgets that enhance user engagement and data analysis. Here's the link: https://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/pull/3706. What do you think, @eid_3f4b2681?", "utterranceID": "20260705-1-81b1d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-1-81b1d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-s-aix-1f811d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-07-05T17:17:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian! This sounds quite relevant. Interactive widgets could definitely make our lead scoring more engaging. We should consider how they handle user interaction and data updates. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260705-2-cf83c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-2-cf83c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-s-aix-1f811d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_07cc9100", "timestamp": "2026-07-05T17:19:00", "text": "Agreed, Hannah. The way JupyterLab integrates these widgets could give us some great ideas for making our UI more dynamic. Maybe we can adapt some of their interaction patterns.", "utterranceID": "20260705-3-55b43"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-3-55b43"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-s-aix-1f811d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-07-05T17:21:00", "text": "Great points! Next, there's a PR from Apache Superset about Enhanced Dashboard Filters. It adds advanced filtering options to improve data exploration. Check it out here: https://github.com/apache/superset/pull/3707. Thoughts, George?", "utterranceID": "20260705-4-72402"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-4-72402"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-s-aix-1f811d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_07cc9100", "timestamp": "2026-07-05T17:24:00", "text": "This could be super useful for us. Advanced filtering can help users drill down into specific lead scores and insights. We should look into how they structure their filters and see if we can implement something similar. 🔍", "utterranceID": "20260705-5-ea63f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-5-ea63f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-s-aix-1f811d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-07-05T17:26:00", "text": "Absolutely, George. Filters are crucial for user experience, especially when dealing with large datasets. Let's make sure our filters are intuitive and powerful.", "utterranceID": "20260705-6-6ca4f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-6-6ca4f"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T11:32:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with LeadForce that we need to address ASAP. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261112-0-54859"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261112-0-54859"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T11:36:00", "text": "First up, we have a Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) issue in the Export Functionality. Malicious scripts can be injected, leading to unauthorized data access. This affects the Data Export Module and poses a risk of data breaches for CUST-0063. @eid_cac9a0ac, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261112-1-b20f7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261112-1-b20f7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_cac9a0ac", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T11:40:00", "text": "Got it! I'll start investigating the XSS issue in the Export Functionality right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 🔍", "utterranceID": "20261112-2-3aa91"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261112-2-3aa91"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T11:45:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have a Notification Overload during the lead import process. It's overwhelming the UI and distracting users, impacting CUST-0091. @eid_a23a73c4, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20261112-3-14563"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261112-3-14563"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a23a73c4", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T11:49:00", "text": "Thanks for assigning this to me. I'll look into the notification overload issue and see how we can streamline the UI during imports. 📥", "utterranceID": "20261112-4-ced72"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261112-4-ced72"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T11:54:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's a Stale Cache Issue where outdated lead data is being served due to improper cache invalidation. This affects the Database Management System and is causing issues for CUST-0023. @eid_a23a73c4, could you handle this one as well?", "utterranceID": "20261112-5-90dd1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261112-5-90dd1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a23a73c4", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T11:59:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll tackle the stale cache issue too. Ensuring accurate data is crucial, so I'll prioritize this. 🗄️", "utterranceID": "20261112-6-67388"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261112-6-67388"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T12:04:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep communication open and update each other on progress. Feel free to ask questions or share insights as you work through these. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261112-7-20ce8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261112-7-20ce8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_cac9a0ac", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T12:07:00", "text": "Will do! If anyone has insights on recent changes to the export module, let me know. It might help with the XSS issue. 🤔", "utterranceID": "20261112-8-9a27d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261112-8-9a27d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a23a73c4", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T12:09:00", "text": "I'll keep you all posted on the notification and cache issues. If anyone has suggestions on optimizing cache invalidation, I'm all ears! 👂", "utterranceID": "20261112-9-c11c1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261112-9-c11c1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T12:14:00", "text": "Perfect! Let's aim to resolve these quickly to keep our customers happy. Thanks for jumping on these so promptly! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261112-10-25315"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261112-10-25315"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T22:40:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some open-source bugs that are similar to the ones we're tackling in Salesforce. Let's take a look and see if we can learn anything from them. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261113-0-757eb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-0-757eb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T22:41:00", "text": "First up, there's an XSS vulnerability in the WordPress comment section. Malicious scripts can be injected, which is similar to our issue in the Export Functionality. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/WordPress/WordPress/pull/629. @eid_cac9a0ac, any thoughts on this?", "utterranceID": "20261113-1-64169"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-1-64169"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T12:44:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that might give us insights into our current issues. Let's take a look and see how they tackled similar problems. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260928-0-82a54"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260928-0-82a54"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T12:46:00", "text": "First up, we have a bug in Redis titled 'Cache Invalidation Bug'. It deals with improper cache invalidation leading to stale data, similar to our 'Caching Layer Inconsistencies' issue. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/redis/redis/pull/613. @Fiona Miller, could you take a look and see if there are any strategies we can apply?", "utterranceID": "20260928-1-71619"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260928-1-71619"}
