{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_652e8cd0", "timestamp": "2026-10-15T06:48:00", "text": "I'll keep you all posted on my progress. Thanks for the support, team! 😊", "utterranceID": "20261015-10-f5750"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261015-10-f5750"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-10-24T22:51:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with LeadForce that we need to address ASAP. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261024-0-e9730"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261024-0-e9730"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-10-24T22:53:00", "text": "First up, we have a security vulnerability in the Lead Data Export module. Sensitive lead information is exposed due to insufficient encryption during export. This is a big risk for data breaches and violates data protection regulations. Impacted customer is CUST-0065. @eid_9f4e2c6f, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261024-1-ce85b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261024-1-ce85b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-10-24T22:56:00", "text": "Got it! I'll prioritize this and start working on a fix right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 🔒", "utterranceID": "20261024-2-0806c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261024-2-0806c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-10-24T22:57:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_9f4e2c6f! Next, we have an issue with UI thread starvation from background tasks. The lead scoring and qualification tasks are consuming too many resources, causing the UI to become unresponsive during import. This is affecting customer CUST-0054. @eid_3f4b2681, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20261024-3-3971c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261024-3-3971c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-10-24T23:02:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll dive into the resource management for those tasks and see how we can optimize it. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261024-4-53940"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261024-4-53940"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-10-24T23:04:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's a data corruption issue in the Lead Database. Some lead records are getting corrupted during write operations, leading to incomplete or incorrect data entries. This is impacting customer CUST-0013. @eid_3f4b2681, can you also take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261024-5-79ec8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261024-5-79ec8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-10-24T23:05:00", "text": "No problem, I'll look into the database write operations and see what's causing the corruption. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20261024-6-6eff1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261024-6-6eff1"}

