{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicetaylor-MonitorForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7ef125"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9ea72e0c", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T17:35:00", "text": "No problem, happy to help! Let me know if there's anything else that needs attention.", "utterranceID": "20260907-8-4f311"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260907-8-4f311"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicetaylor-MonitorForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7ef125"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_be46b656", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:06:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect time zones in our data logging has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/MonitorForce/pull/29.", "utterranceID": "20260909-0-e1bfa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260909-0-e1bfa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicetaylor-MonitorForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7ef125"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5b9ab912", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:11:00", "text": "Great news, Ian! Can you explain what caused the issue?", "utterranceID": "20260909-1-16ae0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260909-1-16ae0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicetaylor-MonitorForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7ef125"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_be46b656", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:14:00", "text": "Sure, Alice. The root cause was a configuration error in the logging system. Different data sources were set to use different time zones, which led to misaligned timestamps in our performance data.", "utterranceID": "20260909-2-2b07d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260909-2-2b07d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicetaylor-MonitorForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7ef125"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c38fe0e7", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:19:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Ian. How did you fix it?", "utterranceID": "20260909-3-43e33"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260909-3-43e33"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicetaylor-MonitorForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7ef125"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_be46b656", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:22:00", "text": "To resolve it, I standardized the time zone setting across all data sources to UTC. This ensures that all timestamps are consistent, and our time-series data aligns correctly.", "utterranceID": "20260909-4-a8876"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260909-4-a8876"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicetaylor-MonitorForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7ef125"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5b9ab912", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:27:00", "text": "That sounds like a solid fix. Thanks for handling this so quickly, @eid_be46b656!", "utterranceID": "20260909-5-6f847"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260909-5-6f847"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicetaylor-MonitorForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7ef125"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c38fe0e7", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:29:00", "text": "Agreed, great work, Ian. This will definitely help with our performance trend analysis.", "utterranceID": "20260909-6-2795f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260909-6-2795f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicetaylor-MonitorForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7ef125"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_be46b656", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:33:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_5b9ab912 and Julia. Let me know if you notice any other issues!", "utterranceID": "20260909-7-18e88"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260909-7-18e88"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicetaylor-MonitorForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7ef125"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_be46b656", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T20:51:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about inconsistent data refresh on the dashboard has been resolved. 🎉", "utterranceID": "20260912-0-e378e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260912-0-e378e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicetaylor-MonitorForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7ef125"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_be46b656", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T20:53:00", "text": "The issue was due to a synchronization problem between the data processing backend and the UI layer, which caused the real-time insights to update inconsistently.", "utterranceID": "20260912-1-f7a6c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260912-1-f7a6c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicetaylor-MonitorForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7ef125"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_be46b656", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T20:58:00", "text": "I've submitted a fix, and you can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/MonitorForce/pull/30", "utterranceID": "20260912-2-d9ad8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260912-2-d9ad8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicetaylor-MonitorForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7ef125"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c38fe0e7", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T21:01:00", "text": "Great news, Ian! Can you explain how you fixed it?", "utterranceID": "20260912-3-6a130"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260912-3-6a130"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicetaylor-MonitorForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7ef125"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_be46b656", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T21:06:00", "text": "Sure, @eid_c38fe0e7. The root cause was a mismatch in the data refresh intervals between the backend and the UI. I adjusted the synchronization mechanism to ensure both layers refresh at the same rate.", "utterranceID": "20260912-4-f1472"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260912-4-f1472"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicetaylor-MonitorForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7ef125"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_be46b656", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T21:10:00", "text": "Additionally, I implemented a buffer system to handle any minor delays in data processing, which should prevent outdated information from being displayed.", "utterranceID": "20260912-5-7589e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260912-5-7589e"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T18:03:00", "text": "First up, we have a PostgreSQL issue titled 'Database Locking Causes System Slowdown'. It deals with heavy locking during concurrent transactions, leading to performance degradation. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/postgres/postgres/pull/159. @eid_4df5d4b7, this seems quite similar to the database locking issue you're working on. Thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20260917-1-30cfc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260917-1-30cfc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T18:08:00", "text": "Thanks, Emma! This is definitely relevant. The PostgreSQL team has some interesting approaches to managing locks that we might be able to adapt. I'll dive into their PR and see what we can learn. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260917-2-8883b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260917-2-8883b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T18:12:00", "text": "Great, Bob! Next, there's an Apache Kafka issue titled 'Real-Time Processing Lag'. It describes delays in message processing under high throughput conditions, which sounds a lot like our real-time processing lag. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/160. Hannah, could you take a look at this one?", "utterranceID": "20260917-3-93677"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260917-3-93677"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92294e45", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T18:13:00", "text": "Sure thing, Emma! The Kafka team's approach to handling high throughput might give us some ideas on optimizing our sentiment analysis engine. I'll review their PR and see what strategies we can apply. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260917-4-a45eb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260917-4-a45eb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T18:15:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks Hannah! Lastly, there's a Django REST Framework issue titled 'Malformed JSON Response Parsing'. It involves incorrect handling of malformed JSON responses, leading to dropped API requests. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/encode/django-rest-framework/pull/161. Bob, since you're already on the JSON parsing issue, could you also check this out?", "utterranceID": "20260917-5-9a47e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260917-5-9a47e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T18:19:00", "text": "Absolutely, Emma! The Django REST Framework's handling of JSON parsing could provide some valuable insights. I'll compare their solution with our current approach and see if we can improve our API integration module. 💪", "utterranceID": "20260917-6-273fa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260917-6-273fa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T18:21:00", "text": "Thanks, Bob! Let's keep these insights in mind as we work on resolving our issues. Let me know if you need any more details or support. Let's get these bugs squashed for our customers! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20260917-7-d2836"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260917-7-d2836"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92294e45", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T18:26:00", "text": "Will do, thanks for coordinating, Emma! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260917-8-29569"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260917-8-29569"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T18:31:00", "text": "Thanks, team! Let's keep our customers happy! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260917-9-8adec"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260917-9-8adec"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:09:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the 'Malformed JSON Response Parsing'.", "utterranceID": "20260921-0-c43da"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-0-c43da"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:12:00", "text": "The system was encountering errors when parsing JSON responses from Slack, which was leading to dropped messages and incomplete sentiment data.", "utterranceID": "20260921-1-c727b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-1-c727b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:15:00", "text": "After reviewing the issue, I've determined that it does not require a fix.", "utterranceID": "20260921-2-72c6a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-2-72c6a"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T03:28:00", "text": "Thanks, David and Charlie! I'll keep you posted if anything else comes up. For now, everything looks good on my end.", "utterranceID": "20261028-5-7846b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-5-7846b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-10-30T09:07:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the time zone misalignment in data processing. After reviewing the bug, I've determined that it does not require a fix.", "utterranceID": "20261030-0-05849"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-0-05849"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-30T09:08:00", "text": "Hey David, can you explain why it's not a bug? The misalignment seemed to cause some confusion on the dashboard.", "utterranceID": "20261030-1-1655b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-1-1655b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-10-30T09:12:00", "text": "Sure, @eid_802e8eff. The backend server processes sentiment data using a default time zone setting. This is actually the expected behavior, as the system is designed to standardize data processing across different regions.", "utterranceID": "20261030-2-ee25c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-2-ee25c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-30T09:15:00", "text": "So, the time zone setting is intentional to ensure consistency in data processing?", "utterranceID": "20261030-3-8b0fa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-3-8b0fa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-10-30T09:16:00", "text": "Exactly, Charlie. The default time zone setting ensures that all sentiment data is processed uniformly, regardless of the user's local time zone. This prevents discrepancies when comparing data from different regions.", "utterranceID": "20261030-4-30a75"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-4-30a75"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-30T09:19:00", "text": "Got it. So, it's more of a user misunderstanding rather than a bug. Did you take any steps to verify this?", "utterranceID": "20261030-5-d1c6a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-5-d1c6a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-10-30T09:21:00", "text": "Yes, I reviewed the server configuration and confirmed that the time zone setting is as intended. I also checked with the product team to ensure this aligns with our design specifications.", "utterranceID": "20261030-6-f8bd9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-6-f8bd9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-30T09:22:00", "text": "Thanks for clarifying, David. Maybe we should update the user documentation to explain this behavior?", "utterranceID": "20261030-7-02865"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-7-02865"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-10-30T09:23:00", "text": "Good idea, Charlie. I'll coordinate with the documentation team to add a note about the time zone settings and their purpose.", "utterranceID": "20261030-8-30011"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-8-30011"}
